-- Section 147B — Cold War Grade 7 Capacity Expansion
-- cold_war, target_grade=7, is_active=true
-- Distribution: B1(2) + B2(4) + B3(6) + B4(5) + B5(3) = 20 questions
-- Topics: Marshall Plan, Korea War, arms race, propaganda, détente, Berlin Blockade,
--         Glasnost/Perestroika, Soviet collapse, MAD doctrine, Vietnam, Afghanistan,
--         Helsinki Accords, nuclear deterrence as stability, Cold War legacy in Russia,
--         Third World proxy wars, technology spin-offs, hotline/crisis comms,
--         inevitability debate, bipolarity theory, USA-China lessons
-- Before: B1=6 B2=7 B3=7 B4=7 B5=0 → 27 active
-- After:  B1=8 B2=11 B3=13 B4=12 B5=3 → 47 active
-- Uses dollar-quoting ($$) throughout.

